#: data/io.github.open_sustain.sustain.metainfo.xml:19
msgid ""
"Sustain is a Linux-native music library and player heavily inspired by the "
"dense, predictable workflow of iTunes circa 2012. It is built around a fast "
"main table view, with first-class playlists, smart playlists, ratings, "
"listening statistics, and search."
